    "detailed_description": "<h1>CHECK OUT THE FREE PROLOGUE</h1><p></p><br><h1>CHECK OUT TOY TINKER SIMULATOR</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428780/extras/d8037153d1d5825305de145a0c7f11d9.poster.avif?t=1740756499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428780/extras/d8037153d1d5825305de145a0c7f11d9.webm?t=1740756499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428780/extras/d8037153d1d5825305de145a0c7f11d9.mp4?t=1740756499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Animal Rescuer is helping lovely animals through exploring an epic world with faster gameplay and increased quest and combat intensity.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Engage in a great roleplaying experience \u2013 achieve quests and complete objectives of the entire story</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Acquire plants to prepare medicine for lovely animals needing help</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Meet new people along the way through fantastic cities and villages of this world</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Demonstrate warrior abilities in epic combats with enemies and bosses</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428780/extras/9bfd92856c01d3a8830670a067482bda.poster.avif?t=1740756499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428780/extras/9bfd92856c01d3a8830670a067482bda.webm?t=1740756499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428780/extras/9bfd92856c01d3a8830670a067482bda.mp4?t=1740756499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428780/extras/2223096e2d1af7023a8becb484e44080.avif?t=1740756499\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428780/extras/551403ae826c0cb3a491cf2ee124614c.poster.avif?t=1740756499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428780/extras/551403ae826c0cb3a491cf2ee124614c.webm?t=1740756499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428780/extras/551403ae826c0cb3a491cf2ee124614c.mp4?t=1740756499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428780/extras/2cb6a967c634265f06ea930a95d47d10.poster.avif?t=1740756499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428780/extras/2cb6a967c634265f06ea930a95d47d10.webm?t=1740756499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428780/extras/2cb6a967c634265f06ea930a95d47d10.mp4?t=1740756499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428780/extras/d8037153d1d5825305de145a0c7f11d9.poster.avif?t=1740756499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428780/extras/d8037153d1d5825305de145a0c7f11d9.webm?t=1740756499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428780/extras/d8037153d1d5825305de145a0c7f11d9.mp4?t=1740756499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Animal Rescuer is helping lovely animals through exploring an epic world with faster gameplay and increased quest and combat intensity.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Engage in a great roleplaying experience \u2013 achieve quests and complete objectives of the entire story</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Acquire plants to prepare medicine for lovely animals needing help</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Meet new people along the way through fantastic cities and villages of this world</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Demonstrate warrior abilities in epic combats with enemies and bosses</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428780/extras/9bfd92856c01d3a8830670a067482bda.poster.avif?t=1740756499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428780/extras/9bfd92856c01d3a8830670a067482bda.webm?t=1740756499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428780/extras/9bfd92856c01d3a8830670a067482bda.mp4?t=1740756499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428780/extras/2223096e2d1af7023a8becb484e4